+# cluster ci-a70284ef7d26941c — macOS Qt 5 build failure in RowTableViewTest
+
+**Verdict: REAL.** The hosted `macos-x86_64` build at `31f559ab479dcd1b822545aae477222f58f32c0d` fails because
+the test calls `QAbstractItemView::itemDelegateForIndex()`, which does not exist in Qt 5. The product class
+`lmms::gui::RowTableView` is fine (`include/RowTableView.h:37`, `src/gui/RowTableView.cpp:113-121`); only the test's
+API spelling was Qt-6-only. The CI runner uses `/usr/local/opt/qt@5` (the failing log points at Qt5 headers), so this
+is a test/portability regression, not a product-behaviour bug.
+
+## Evidence
+
+- Failure lines: `tests/src/gui/RowTableViewTest.cpp:54` and `:57` before the change called
+  `view.itemDelegateForIndex(...)`.
+- Qt 5.15 declares only `QAbstractItemDelegate *itemDelegate(const QModelIndex &index) const;` —
+  `/usr/include/qt/QtWidgets/qabstractitemview.h:226`.
+- Qt 6 declares `itemDelegateForIndex(const QModelIndex &) const` (and forwards the deprecated
+  `itemDelegate(index)` to it) — `/usr/include/qt6/QtWidgets/qabstractitemview.h:204-208`.
+- `RowTableView` inherits `QTableView` and adds no such method: `include/RowTableView.h:37`.
+- The exact prior repair exists on another branch (`9ccb6cc841`, `fix/ci-train21`: “RowTableViewTest:
+  itemDelegateForIndex is Qt 6; Qt 5 uses itemDelegate(index)”), but **not on this branch** — the test at HEAD is the
+  broken version, so this is not ALREADY-FIXED here.
+- Fix: `tests/src/gui/RowTableViewTest.cpp:32-39` adds a `QT_VERSION`-guarded `rowDelegate()` helper
+  (`itemDelegateForIndex` on Qt 6, `itemDelegate(index)` on Qt 5) and uses it at `:64` and `:67`. Only
+  `RowTableViewTest.cpp` changed; no product code, no project data, no audio path.
+
+## Test matrix
+
+| Path | Test | Result |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Supported-platform build (Qt 5.15, the macOS CI API level) | standalone Qt 5 build + run of `RowTableViewTest` | RED without fix (`EXIT=1`, exact two `itemDelegateForIndex` errors); GREEN with fix (`EXIT=0`, 6 passed) |
+| Normal delegate path | `insertedRowsUseTheRowDelegate` (Qt 5 and Qt 6) | PASS |
+| Model clearing | `clearingModelIsSafe` | PASS |
+| Keyboard without a model | `tabAndBacktabWithoutModelAreSafe` | PASS |
+| Keyboard after clearing the model | `tabAndBacktabAfterClearingModelAreSafe` | PASS |
+| Local configured build (Qt 6.12) | `cmake --build build --target RowTableViewTest` + `ctest -R '^RowTableViewTest$'` | PASS, 1/1 tests executed |
+| Audio thread | not touched — test-only source change | n/a |
+
+The regression is deterministic and compile-time/platform-level: no clock, sleeps, races or injected timing are
+involved. The same test source is built by both Qt 5 and Qt 6 CI legs; Qt 5 is the leg that catches a reintroduced
+unguarded call.
+
